---
import '../../styles/coaching-portal.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="fr">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#06142d" />
    <title>Ma prochaine séance — Sonny Court Coaching</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="cp-ambient" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
    <div class="app-layout">
      <aside class="app-sidebar cp-glass">
        <a class="cp-brand" href="/"><span class="cp-mark">S</span><span>MON COACHING</span></a>
        <div class="role-identity">
          <span class="role-avatar student" data-student-avatar><span data-student-initials>CM</span></span>
          <span><small>Espace personnel</small><strong data-student-full-name>Claire Martin</strong></span>
        </div>
        <nav class="app-nav" aria-label="Navigation élève">
          <p>Mon espace</p>
          <a href="/coaching/eleve"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect></svg>Vue d’ensemble</a>
          <a class="active" href="/coaching/seance"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"></path></svg>Ma prochaine séance</a>
          <a href="/coaching/preparation"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z"></path><path d="M14 2v6h6M8 13h8M8 17h6"></path></svg>Ma préparation</a>
          <a href="/coaching/reserver"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"></rect><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg>Réserver</a>
          <p>Mon wallet</p>
          <a href="/coaching/credits"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7H14a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path></svg>Ajouter des crédits</a>
          <a href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Mon compte</a>
        </nav>
        <div class="sidebar-foot"><strong>Ton accès visio reste ici</strong><small>Le lien apparaît automatiquement dès que Google Meet l’a généré.</small><a href="#" data-logout>Se déconnecter</a></div>
      </aside>

      <main class="app-main">
        <header class="app-topbar">
          <div><p>Espace de <span data-student-first-name>Claire</span></p><h1>Ma prochaine séance</h1></div>
          <div class="top-actions"><span class="cp-status" data-session-top-status>Chargement</span><a class="top-profile" href="/coaching/compte"><span class="role-avatar student" data-student-avatar><span data-student-initials>CM</span></span><span><strong data-student-first-name>Claire</strong><small>Mon compte</small></span></a></div>
        </header>

        <div class="app-content">
          <div class="content-wrap">
            <section class="page-intro session-intro">
              <div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Ton accès au rendez-vous</p><h2>Le jour J, tout se passe <em>ici.</em></h2><p>La date, ton coach et le bouton Google Meet sont regroupés au même endroit. Tu n’as rien à chercher dans tes emails.</p></div>
            </section>

            <section class="session-loading cp-glass" data-session-loading aria-live="polite">
              <span></span><p>Recherche de ta prochaine séance…</p>
            </section>

            <section class="session-focus-layout" data-session-booked hidden>
              <article class="session-focus-card cp-glass">
                <header><div><p class="cp-eyebrow">Rendez-vous confirmé</p><h2 data-session-date>—</h2></div><span class="cp-status">Confirmée</span></header>
                <div class="session-coach">
                  <img data-coach-avatar src="/media/coachs/romain.webp?v=ai-hd" alt="Romain" width="64" height="64" />
                  <span><small>Ta séance individuelle avec</small><strong data-coach-name>Romain</strong><b data-session-duration>45 minutes</b></span>
                </div>
                <div class="session-meet-panel" data-session-meet-waiting>
                  <span class="session-meet-icon"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"></path></svg></span>
                  <div><strong>Lien Google Meet en préparation</strong><p>Le bouton s’activera ici automatiquement dès la synchronisation du calendrier.</p></div>
                  <span class="session-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                </div>
                <a class="session-meet-button" data-session-meet-link href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>
                  <svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"></path></svg>
                  <span><small>Ta salle est prête</small><strong>Rejoindre sur Google Meet</strong></span>
                  <b>Ouvrir →</b>
                </a>
                <div class="session-actions"><button class="cp-button secondary" type="button" data-download-calendar>Ajouter au calendrier</button><a class="cp-button secondary" href="/coaching/confirmation">Voir les détails</a></div>
                <p class="session-notice" data-session-notice>Le lien Meet apparaîtra ici dès sa création.</p>
              </article>

              <aside class="session-guide cp-glass">
                <p class="cp-eyebrow">Le jour de la séance</p>
                <h3>Trois repères simples.</h3>
                <ol><li><span>01</span><p><strong>Reviens dans cet onglet.</strong><small>Le bouton Meet sera visible ici.</small></p></li><li><span>02</span><p><strong>Connecte-toi 2 minutes avant.</strong><small>Teste simplement ton micro et ta caméra.</small></p></li><li><span>03</span><p><strong>Entre dans la salle.</strong><small>Romain te rejoint sur Google Meet.</small></p></li></ol>
                <a href="/coaching/preparation">Mettre à jour ma préparation →</a>
              </aside>
            </section>

            <section class="session-empty cp-glass" data-session-empty hidden>
              <span class="session-empty-icon"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"></rect><path d="M8 3v4M16 3v4M3 10h18"></path></svg></span>
              <p class="cp-eyebrow">Aucune séance réservée</p>
              <h2>Ton prochain rendez-vous apparaîtra ici.</h2>
              <p>Une fois le créneau choisi, cette page affichera la date puis ton bouton Google Meet.</p>
              <div class="session-empty-preview"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"></path></svg><span><strong>Rejoindre sur Google Meet</strong><small>Disponible après la réservation</small></span></div>
              <a class="cp-button" href="/coaching/reserver">Choisir un créneau</a>
            </section>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <nav class="mobile-nav student-mobile-nav cp-glass"><a href="/coaching/eleve"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"></rect></svg>Accueil</a><a class="active" href="/coaching/seance"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="6" width="13" height="12" rx="3"></rect><path d="m16 10 5-3v10l-5-3"></path></svg>Séance</a><a href="/coaching/reserver"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="16" rx="3"></rect><path d="M3 10h18"></path></svg>Réserver</a><a href="/coaching/credits"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7H14"></path></svg>Crédits</a><a href="/coaching/compte"><svg class="cp-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"></circle><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path></svg>Compte</a></nav>
    <script>import '../../scripts/coaching-next-session.js';</script>
  </body>
</html>
